It&#x27;s not that awkward, C# does the same thing:<p><pre><code>   interface IPoint
    {
   // Property signatures: 
   int x
   {
      get;
      set;
   }

   int y
   {
      get;
      set;
   }
   }
</code></pre>
(taken from <a href="http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/87d83y5b.aspx" rel="nofollow">http://msdn.microsoft.com/en-us/library/87d83y5b.aspx</a>)
